<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Happy Birthday Shivani 🎉</title>

<style>
body{
  margin:0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #000000, #1a001f);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  font-family:Arial;
  overflow:hidden;
}

/* glowing text */
h1{
  margin-top:50px;
  font-size:45px;
  animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow{
  from{ text-shadow:0 0 10px #ff00ff; }
  to{ text-shadow:0 0 30px #00ffff; }
}

/* cake */
.cake{
  font-size:120px;
  margin-top:20px;
  animation: bounce 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes bounce{
  0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
  50%{transform:translateY(-25px);}
}

/* text */
p{
  font-size:18px;
  margin:20px;
  line-height:1.6;
}

/* fireworks */
.firework{
  position:absolute;
  width:6px;
  height:6px;
  background:yellow;
  border-radius:50%;
  animation: explode 1s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes explode{
  from{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}
  to{transform:scale(25);opacity:0;}
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>🎉 Happy Birthday Shivani Chutki ❤️ 🎉</h1>

<div class="cake">🎂</div>

<p>
Sorry yrr late wish karne ke liye 😅💔<br><br>

Tu meri best friend hai ❤️<br>
Main tujhe genuinely respect aur care karta hu 🤝✨<br><br>

Aaj ka din sirf tera hai 🎉<br>
Smile karti reh aur enjoy kar 😊🔥<br><br>

👉 Once again Happy Birthday Shivani 🎂💫
</p>

<script>
function firework(){
  let f = document.createElement("div");
  f.className = "firework";
  f.style.left = Math.random()*window.innerWidth + "px";
  f.style.top = Math.random()*window.innerHeight + "px";
  document.body.appendChild(f);

  setTimeout(()=>{ f.remove(); },1000);
}

setInterval(firework,150);
</script>

</body>
</html>
